ge":{"*":["返回上一页"]},"Keep all packages selected":{"*":["保持所有软件包处于选中状态"]},"Mark all packages for removal":{"*":["将所有软件包标记为移除"]},"Proceed to the next step":{"*":["进入下一步"]},"System Maintenance":{"*":["系统维护"]},"Uncheck the programs you want to remove":{"*":["取消勾选要移除的程序"]},"Installation Tips":{"*":["安装提示"]},"The system is in {boot_mode}, Linux {kernel} and graphical mode {session}.":{"*":["系统处于 {boot_mode}，Linux {kernel} 和图形模式 {session}。"]},"The system is in {boot_mode}, Linux {kernel}.":{"*":["系统处于 {boot_mode}，Linux {kernel}。"]},"Snapshot and backups":{"*":["快照和备份"]},"Restore restore points of the installed system.":{"*":["恢复已安装系统的还原点。"]},"Start":{"*":["开始"]},"Restore system settings":{"*":["恢复系统设置"]},"Utility that facilitates the restoration of the installed system, especially the restoration of the system boot (Grub).\n\nIt can also be used to access the package manager and terminal of the installed system.":{"*":["用于恢复已安装系统的实用程序，特别是系统引导（Grub）的恢复。\n\n它还可以用于访问已安装系统的包管理器和终端。"]},"EFI Entry Manager":{"*":["EFI 启动项管理器"]},"Advanced tool to add, remove, or change boot entries in the UEFI firmware.":{"*":["用于在UEFI固件中添加、删除或更改启动项的高级工具。"]},"System Maintenance: choose Snapshot, Restore, or EFI Manager":{"*":["系统维护：选择快照、恢复或 EFI 管理器"]},"Loading packages":{"*":["加载软件包"]},"Loading packages...":{"*":["正在加载软件包..."]},"Package list":{"*":["软件包列表"]},"Toggle switches to keep or remove packages":{"*":["用于保留或移除软件包的开关"]},"{count} packages loaded":{"*":["已加载 {count} 个软件包"]},"Keep {name}":{"*":["保留 {name}"]},"Failed to load packages: {}":{"*":["加载软件包失败：{}"]},"Starting...":{"*":["启动中..."]},"Minimal installation: select packages to keep or remove":{"*":["最小化安装：选择要保留或移除的软件包"]},"This is a collaborative system, if you need help consult our forum.":{"*":["该系统由社区协作开发。如需帮助，请访问我们的论坛。"]},"Maintenance":{"*":["系统维护"]},"Tools that facilitate the maintenance of the installed system.":{"*":["用于简化已安装系统维护的工具。"]},"Restore":{"*":["恢复"]},"Installation":{"*":["安装"]},"The system is in live mode, which has limitations.":{"*":["系统当前运行于 Live 模式，存在一些限制。"]},"Install it for a complete experience.":{"*":["安装后即可获得完整体验。"]},"Install":{"*":["安装"]},"Minimal":{"*":["最小化安装"]},"Remove pre-selected software to create a lean, personalized system.":{"*":["移除预选软件，创建轻量且个性化的系统。"]},"Configuring...":{"*":["正在配置..."]},"Main page: choose Maintenance, Installation, or Minimal":{"*":["主页：选择“系统维护”“安装”或“最小化安装”"]},"Important Tips":{"*":["重要提示"]},"Manual Partitioning Recommendations":{"*":["手动分区建议"]},"If you opt for automatic partitioning, these tips will be applied by default.":{"*":["如果选择自动分区，这些建议将默认应用。"]},"Use BTRFS":{"*":["使用 BTRFS"]},"This file system allows for automatic compression and restore points.":{"*":["此文件系统支持自动压缩和创建还原点。"]},"Keep /boot within the / partition":{"*":["将 /boot 保留在 / 分区内"]},"Placing it in a separate partition hampers BTRFS snapshots.":{"*":["将 /boot 放在单独的分区会影响 BTRFS 快照的使用。"]},"Do not create a SWAP partition":{"*":["不要创建 SWAP 分区"]},"We have implemented dynamic virtual memory management with Zram and SWAP files. SWAP partitions will not be used.":{"*":["我们已使用 Zram 和 SWAP 文件实现动态虚拟内存管理。系统不会使用 SWAP 分区。"]},"Installation tips: read the recommendations before proceeding":{"*":["安装提示：继续之前请阅读建议"]},"Please wait...":{"*":["请稍候..."]},"Checking the integrity of the download and storage device...":{"*":["正在检查下载内容和存储设备的完整性..."]},"Checking system integrity":{"*":["正在检查系统完整性"]},"Checking for download or USB drive errors, this may take a few minutes...":{"*":["正在检查下载内容或 U 盘是否存在错误，这可能需要几分钟..."]},"Verification progress":{"*":["验证进度"]},"Checking the file: {filename}":{"*":["正在检查文件：{filename}"]},"Verification failed":{"*":["验证失败"]},"The live media could not be verified. Download the system again or use another USB drive.":{"*":["无法验证 Live 启动介质。请重新下载系统或换用其他 U 盘。"]},"Verification complete":{"*":["验证完成"]},"The files are intact.":{"*":["文件完好无损。"]},"Verification canceled":{"*":["验证已取消"]},"The integrity check was not completed.":{"*":["完整性检查未完成。"]},"Progress":{"*":["进度"]},"Question":{"*":["问题"]},"Close":{"*":